From f0504d6f0f6d6d2ab4f1292e5319461dd571754a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pawtation fork <fork@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:13:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Pawtation theme (unofficial): Nova mascot and start-up
 quip

Title bar gains a 4-frame Nova idle sticker (64x64, RGB5A3, nearest) and
one quip line picked at boot from pawtation/quips.txt on the boot device.
The read is bounded (4 KB, 40 lines, 60 printable ASCII chars per line),
uses static buffers only, happens once on the main thread right after the
stock backdrop load, and falls back to a built-in line on any problem.
The temperature readout moves to row 2 to give the quip room.
PAWTATION_MASCOT 0 in pawtation.h turns the feature off.
